  <p>
    Practical proof formats that work across almost every track above: a published op-ed or letter
    in a real outlet, a policy brief written to an actual institution's format, a Model UN or moot
    court record, an internship at PRS Legislative Research, a think tank, an MP or MLA's office, or
    an election campaign, and a public archive of your own writing — even a simple newsletter —
    tracking one specific policy area consistently.
  </p>

